{"schemaVersion":2,"dialogueId":"Dlg_5F83A8BD","title":"Nixxy at the Docks","entry":"Dlg_5F83A8BD::entry","exit":"Dlg_5F83A8BD::exit","nodes":[{"id":"DFr_4398F44E","articyId":"72057645577539992","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Nixxy","text":"Hello, Nixxy's Pixies! I am once again coming to you from the heart of the LUZ! Today we're in The Dank Dank Docks! And look, we found Noodle Nut! What should we ask them?","speakerId":"Ntt_1DBCCD4D","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Hello, Nixxy's Pixies! I am once again coming to you from the heart of the LUZ! Today we're in The Dank Dank Docks! And look, we found Noodle Nut! What should we ask them?","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":3,"name":"Happy"},"position":{"x":0.0,"y":0.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"26925","byteOffset":18066800,"byteLength":516}},{"id":"DFr_6A543A1D","articyId":"72057645577540013","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Nixxy","text":"Ok, whatever. Look, we're not live right now. I'm waiting on the results of the poll and they're all voting while an ad streams.","speakerId":"Ntt_1DBCCD4D","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Ok, whatever. Look, we're not live right now. I'm waiting on the results of the poll and they're all voting while an ad streams.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":600.0,"y":0.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"22569","byteOffset":16424600,"byteLength":472}},{"id":"DFr_26C592A6","articyId":"72057645577540035","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Nixxy","text":"Ok, we're back. This hot young thing is called Noodle Nut. They might be a small business owner with no money, but they're in luck today! So my first question is... are you a virgin?","speakerId":"Ntt_1DBCCD4D","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Ok, we're back. This hot young thing is called Noodle Nut. They might be a small business owner with no money, but they're in luck today! So my first question is... are you a virgin?","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":3,"name":"Happy"},"position":{"x":1200.0,"y":0.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"48509","byteOffset":32687000,"byteLength":564}},{"id":"DFr_EB95F100","articyId":"72057645577540064","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Nixxy","text":"You've never had a girl like me pay attention to you, right? So my question is this... would you let me spit in your mouth for 100 Lims.","speakerId":"Ntt_1DBCCD4D","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"You've never had a girl like me pay attention to you, right? So my question is this... would you let me spit in your mouth for 100 Lims.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":1800.0,"y":0.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"52381","byteOffset":34230624,"byteLength":516}},{"id":"DFr_2A2E4ABB","articyId":"72057645577540094","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Nixxy","text":"Haha, as IF! Can you believe that folks. Pay out on \"yes\". Double your channel points. Why not play again?","speakerId":"Ntt_1DBCCD4D","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Haha, as IF! Can you believe that folks. Pay out on \"yes\". Double your channel points. Why not play again?","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":4,"name":"Shocked"},"position":{"x":2400.0,"y":125.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"50913","byteOffset":33600512,"byteLength":416}},{"id":"DFr_05A4A85E","articyId":"72057645577540102","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Nixxy","text":"Ewww! What is wrong with you? Well, fine. We pay out on \"no\". What should we bet on next folks? Double your channel points!","speakerId":"Ntt_1DBCCD4D","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Ewww! What is wrong with you? Well, fine. We pay out on \"no\". What should we bet on next folks? Double your channel points!","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":4,"name":"Shocked"},"position":{"x":2400.0,"y":-225.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"36733","byteOffset":28239608,"byteLength":432}},{"id":"DFr_43F1F4D2","articyId":"72057645577540129","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Nixxy","text":"Haha, what a weirdo. Ok, well let's find someone better. Boring!","speakerId":"Ntt_1DBCCD4D","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Haha, what a weirdo. Ok, well let's find someone better. Boring!","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":3000.0,"y":-225.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"17631","byteOffset":14559192,"byteLength":372}},{"id":"DFr_3B12EC88","articyId":"72057645577540137","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Nixxy","text":"Oh you wanna get in on this? Well I'm not looking for a partner. Yet. But... well it could work. What could you bring to the table? I'm offline right now by the way. Running another ad. So, you know, make your case before we're back on air.","speakerId":"Ntt_1DBCCD4D","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Oh you wanna get in on this? Well I'm not looking for a partner. Yet. But... well it could work. What could you bring to the table? I'm offline right now by the way. Running another ad. So, you know, make your case before we're back on air.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":3300.0,"y":125.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"52474","byteOffset":34264912,"byteLength":620}},{"id":"DFr_C9B08D17","articyId":"72057645577540165","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Nixxy","text":"Boring! See you later. I mean, maybe. If there is absolutely NO ONE else to entertain us.","speakerId":"Ntt_1DBCCD4D","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Boring! See you later. I mean, maybe. If there is absolutely NO ONE else to entertain us.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":6,"name":"Sad"},"position":{"x":6900.0,"y":350.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"19332","byteOffset":15197448,"byteLength":400}},{"id":"DFr_E7028713","articyId":"72057645577540173","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Nixxy","text":"Wait, really. That's... that's potentially gold dust right there. On command you say?","speakerId":"Ntt_1DBCCD4D","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Wait, really. That's... that's potentially gold dust right there. On command you say?","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":5,"name":"Smile"},"position":{"x":4200.0,"y":450.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"40586","byteOffset":29683000,"byteLength":432}},{"id":"DFr_A4210980","articyId":"72057645577540198","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Nixxy","text":"How would you feel about a skit where I come to your noodle stand and try to cook something? But it's disgusting. But we make you eat it because everyone is chanting \"eat it, eat it!\"","speakerId":"Ntt_1DBCCD4D","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"How would you feel about a skit where I come to your noodle stand and try to cook something? But it's disgusting. But we make you eat it because everyone is chanting \"eat it, eat it!\"","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":5,"name":"Smile"},"position":{"x":4800.0,"y":425.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"38078","byteOffset":28740152,"byteLength":528}},{"id":"DFr_0C993DA2","articyId":"72057645577540222","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Nixxy","text":"Could you cry a bit too? If I paid you, would you cry on stream while eating the food? What if it was poisoned? Not lethal, just enough to make you ill for a few days. Could you plead by saying something like, \"But please, I have a family!\"?","speakerId":"Ntt_1DBCCD4D","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Could you cry a bit too? If I paid you, would you cry on stream while eating the food? What if it was poisoned? Not lethal, just enough to make you ill for a few days. Could you plead by saying something like, \"But please, I have a family!\"?","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":5400.0,"y":700.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"33865","byteOffset":20694216,"byteLength":588}},{"id":"DFr_3B171F40","articyId":"72057645577540238","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Nixxy","text":"Dude, what is wrong with you? Get some self respect.","speakerId":"Ntt_1DBCCD4D","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Dude, what is wrong with you? Get some self respect.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":2,"name":"Upset"},"position":{"x":6300.0,"y":650.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"37480","byteOffset":28517416,"byteLength":360}},{"id":"DFr_B4529D71","articyId":"72057645577539998","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"That's not my name.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"That's not my name.","TextSheVersion":"That's not my name.","TextTheyVersion":"That's not my name."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":300.0,"y":-100.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"23060","byteOffset":16609008,"byteLength":300}},{"id":"DFr_4CE7934C","articyId":"72057645577540006","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"\"Noodle Nut\". I like it","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"\"Noodle Nut\". I like it","TextSheVersion":"\"Noodle Nut\". I like it","TextTheyVersion":"\"Noodle Nut\". I like it"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":300.0,"y":125.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"16782","byteOffset":14242808,"byteLength":304}},{"id":"DFr_44965923","articyId":"72057645577540021","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"Do you have an audience or something?","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Do you have an audience or something?","TextSheVersion":"Do you have an audience or something?","TextTheyVersion":"Do you have an audience or something?"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":900.0,"y":-100.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"33608","byteOffset":20597640,"byteLength":320}},{"id":"DFr_89B413DF","articyId":"72057645577540027","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"What are you talking about?!","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"What are you talking about?!","TextSheVersion":"What are you talking about?!","TextTheyVersion":"What are you talking about?!"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":900.0,"y":125.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"17148","byte